---
// SuperpositionSection.astro - Section 04: Quantum Superposition Visual & Mathematical Deep Dive
---

<section class="landing-section superposition-section" id="sectionSuperposition">
  <div class="section-header-block" id="superpositionTitle">
    <div class="section-tag">
      <span class="tag-number">03</span>
      <span class="tag-label">QUANTUM PRINCIPLE</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-main-heading">
      SUPERPOSITION
    </h2>
    <p class="section-sub-heading">
      "Before measurement, multiple possibilities coexist simultaneously."
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="superposition-display-card glass-panel" id="superpositionFormula">
    <!-- Dirac Mathematical Expression -->
    <div class="dirac-expression-box">
      <div class="state-transform-row">
        <span class="dirac-state basis-zero">|0⟩</span>
        <span class="transform-arrow">──[ H ]──▶</span>
        <span class="dirac-state superposition-state">
          <span class="frac">
            <span class="frac-num">|0⟩ + |1⟩</span>
            <span class="frac-denom">√2</span>
          </span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="state-meta-caption">
        Hadamard transformation maps pure basis state into an equal amplitude quantum superposition.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Probability Density Visualization Bars -->
    <div class="probability-meters-grid">
      <div class="prob-meter-box">
        <div class="prob-meter-header">
          <span class="meter-state">STATE |0⟩</span>
          <span class="meter-value" id="valState0">50.0%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meter-track">
          <div class="meter-fill fill-cyan" id="probBar0" style="width: 50%;"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="meter-sub">Phase Angle: 0.00 rad (0°)</div>
      </div>

      <div class="prob-meter-box">
        <div class="prob-meter-header">
          <span class="meter-state">STATE |1⟩</span>
          <span class="meter-value" id="valState1">50.0%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meter-track">
          <div class="meter-fill fill-emerald" id="probBar1" style="width: 50%;"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="meter-sub">Phase Angle: 0.00 rad (0°)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Technical Analysis Footnote -->
    <div class="superposition-analysis-grid">
      <div class="analysis-item">
        <span class="analysis-icon">Ψ</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="analysis-title">Coexisting State Amplitudes</h4>
          <p class="analysis-desc">
            The quantum system exists as a complex linear combination of basis states α|0⟩ + β|1⟩ where |α|² + |β|² = 1.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="analysis-item">
        <span class="analysis-icon">⚡</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="analysis-title">Game Mechanic Integration</h4>
          <p class="analysis-desc">
            Superposition creates uncertain containment barriers and exit portals. Navigating shifting sectors continuous feeds phase rotations into the circuit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .superposition-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 24px;
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .superposition-display-card {
    padding: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .dirac-expression-box {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .state-transform-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .basis-zero {
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .transform-arrow {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.7em;
  }

  .superposition-state {
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.4);
  }

  .frac {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    vertical-align: middle;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8em;
  }

  .frac-num {
    border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  .frac-denom {
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  .state-meta-caption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .probability-meters-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .prob-meter-box {
    background: rgba(10, 16, 26, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .prob-meter-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .meter-state {
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .meter-value {
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
  }

  .meter-track {
    height: 8px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .meter-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }

  .fill-cyan {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00f0ff, #38bdf8);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .fill-emerald {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00f59b, #34d399);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.6);
  }

  .meter-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .superposition-analysis-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .analysis-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .analysis-icon {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
  }

  .analysis-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .analysis-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .superposition-display-card {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
